OL,3,GNEWSASon's decomposed body found after
OL,4,Amother's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe body of a man who may have lain
OL,7,Fdead in a bedroom for several years was
OL,8,Fonly found following his mother's death
OL,9,Fat the family home, an inquest has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FThe decomposed remains of Carl Sampson,
OL,13,Fbelieved to have died about six years
OL,14,Fearlier, were found in the house in
OL,15,FRotherham on 21 March after a neighbour
OL,16,Fsaw his mother Ann Sampson, 73, lying
OL,17,Fon the living room floor.
OL,19,FPolice found damage from an electrical
OL,20,Ffire downstairs and her son, who had
OL,21,Fbeen in his 50s, was found upstairs,
OL,22,Fthe inquest heard.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
